{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "librarian-title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": -200,
      "width": 3980,
      "height": 220,
      "text": "# Proposed to-be mixed-batch enrichment\n**Symptom:** The current mixed dispatcher accounts for source and folder stages but has no integrated agent owner for meaning, package conformance or bounded repair.\n**Root cause:** Retain the existing mixed ledger while adding bounded Lead ownership, Clerk/Scribe proposals and independent child-contract review.\nLanes are actors; red arrows are extensions (numbered); red ends are ways the use case ends without success; orange cards call another use case. Generated from `proposed-batch-enrichment.spec.yaml`."
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-s",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 70,
      "text": "● start",
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-contract",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "Proposed child of ingestion. It inherits one commission, Lead and mixed ledger; source references describe the selected item's work, not another batch worker.",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-bind",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**1.** owns the parent's admitted mixed work and required child outputs; plans accepted components within the existing mandate",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-admit",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 740,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**2.** checks recorded parent specification, approved selection, start grants, role assignments and receipt keys; keeps the original mixed ledger",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-dadmit",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◇ recorded admission and frozen work?",
      "color": "5",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-nextitem",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 1940,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**3.** selects the next frozen item in mixed order; retains completed siblings and each item's original identity",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-noworkhandoff",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 1140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "returns no fresh child work and reconciled receipt states; outstanding parent decisions remain outstanding rather than becoming implied success",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-pausehandoff_at_bdfe8aaefe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 1340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "returns the stop reason, retained receipts and exact continuation or reserved-authority request to the parent; does not commission another run",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-escalatehandoff_at_d74d2f9cb5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 640,
      "y": 1540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "immediately reports critical or run-wide trust failure to the invoking parent for its Owner or tier-0 route, preserving evidence and completed work",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Lead (tier 1)"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-controls",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3040,
      "y": 2140,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "**4.** checks spend before the item and writer, cancellation, grants and critical flags at every dispatch or commit; reuses only compatible receipts",
      "librarian": {
        "actor_lane": "Core"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-enowork",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3640,
      "y": 1340,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◉ no fresh admitted child work; parent must still account for its remaining obligations\n*outcome: reused*",
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "librarian-epaused_at_bdfe8aaefe",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3640,
      "y": 1540,
      "width": 360,
      "height": 150,
      "text": "◉ retained work awaits explicit continuation, a reserved decision or required authority from the parent\n*outcome: paused*",
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
